<title>UK: BOE to publish accounts, George in news conference.</title>
<headline>BOE to publish accounts, George in news conference.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England will publish its annual report at 1030 GMT and its Governor Eddie George will hold a news conference at the same time, the central bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The report and accounts come the day after Chancellor of the Exchequer Gordon Brown announced that the BOE's responsibility for regulating the British banking industry will be transferred to an enlarged Securities and Investments Board (SIB).</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8864.</p>
</text>
